  "description": "People are not what they seem.\n\nJack, an animal taxidermist, is branded as a murderer. He was the only one found at the horrendous site, surrounded by blood and a mutilated corpse. The catch: he can’t remember any of it. To escape the stinging glares, he decides to stay at a house for outcasts in the middle of the woods. But could his housemates be hiding secrets of their own?\n\n(Source: Manta)",
